  "body": "First year of body corporate fees covered by the vendor. \r\n\r\nNestled in the heart of Milford, 304/110 Kitchener Road is a stunning brand-new apartment that offers a perfect blend of modern living and coastal charm. This exquisite two-bedroom plus flexi room residence presents a unique opportunity for those seeking an idyllic lifestyle, from the tranquillity of the sea views to the convenience of local amenities right at your doorstep. With its contemporary design and high-end finishes, this apartment is a true haven for those who appreciate luxury and comfort.\r\n\r\nAs you step into this beautiful home, you will be greeted by an inviting open-plan living area, seamlessly connecting to a private deck that overlooks the ocean, providing a serene backdrop for relaxation or entertaining guests. The designer kitchen is a culinary enthusiast's dream, boasting state of the art appliances, stylish cabinetry, and an abundance of counter space, making mealtime a joyous occasion. With two spacious bedrooms, including a master suite with an ensuite, this apartment comfortably accommodates residents and visitors alike. The chic bathroom features modern fittings and elegant fixtures, contributing to the upscale ambience that defines the space. In addition, the apartment includes a dedicated parking space, ensuring convenience when returning from your local shopping trips or beach outings.\r\n\r\nSituated right amidst the vibrant Milford shopping precinct, residents have easy access to an array of boutiques, cafés, and restaurants, making it a perfect spot for socialising or indulging in a delightful meal. Proximity to Lake Pupuke and the picturesque Milford Beach offers countless opportunities for outdoor activities, from water sports to leisurely strolls along the sandy shores. The location not only provides a serene coastal lifestyle but also ensures you're never far from the hustle and bustle of daily conveniences.\r\n\r\nThis exceptional apartment at 304/110 Kitchener Road is a rare find, combining luxury living with an unbeatable location. Don’t miss your chance to embrace the best of Milford; contact us today to arrange a private viewing and explore your new coastal sanctuary. Your dream home awaits!\r\n\r\nContact Devon Francis from New Zealand Sotheby's International Realty for more information.",
